00:20:32,688 --> 00:20:38,848
And so you can think about maybe the distance between two atoms changing slightly or the angle between two atoms changing slightly.

205
00:20:39,020 --> 00:20:43,568
Well, for synthetic biosequence, we're actually changing the selection of an individual amino acid.

