00:22:05,968 --> 00:22:06,528
Generally, yes.

223
00:22:06,928 --> 00:22:07,808
Overall bad.

224
00:22:08,048 --> 00:22:08,368
Okay.

225
00:22:09,486 --> 00:22:19,248
and then at least then, if these companies are able to detect whether something is AI, it sort of puts an extra safeguard in place, an extra sort of stop in place before they just can continue on.

226
00:22:20,128 --> 00:22:28,928
And something that if you detect the watermark, you have confidence that this was derived from a system that has built-in safety guard rails versus either maybe another AI model or something that comes from nature.

